  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MALOSO IRRIGATION PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT ENVISAGES THE CONSTRUCTION OF AN IRRIGATION WEIR AT THE SEKKA_SEKKA SITE ON THE MALOSO RIVER AND THE PROVISIO N OF AN IRRIGATION NETWORK WITH THE REQUIRED IRRIGATION STRUCTURES INCLUDING DRAINAGE CANALS AND CONTROL DEVICES.THE PROJECT WILL DELIVER IRRIGATION WATER TO ABOUT 8604 HA OF AGRICULTURAL LAND AND FRESH WATER FOR FISH POND AREA OF 3,144 HA TO THE LEFT AND RIGHT BANK OF THE MALOSO RIVER.</narrative>
  </description>
